1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,640
Greetings, Noble Lady Wu'an.

4
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,240
Lord Lu came about an old case

5
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,560
and visited
the Court of Justice late at night.

6
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:10,000
I made an exception and pulled
the case files from 16 years ago.

7
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,160
What case?

8
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,920
Sixteen years ago,
during the Lantern Festival,

9
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,320
the young daughter
of the Earl of Cheng'an's second branch,

10
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:22,560
Wei Rao, was kidnapped and trafficked.

11
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:26,920
Afterward, her wet nurse and guards
fled in fear of punishment.

12
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,760
On their way to South Mountain,
bandits killed them.

13
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,560
His Majesty was furious.

14
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,600
He ordered the Court of Justice
to handle the case.

15
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:35,480
He also sent troops
to search the entire city,

16
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,400
but there was no news.

17
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,720
Not until May the following year,

18
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,160
when the Wei family

19
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,680
found the girl at a market
after she'd been missing for a year.

20
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,440
What was she wearing

21
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,720
the day she was kidnapped?

22
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,640
At the time,

23
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,920
Lady Wei Rao was barely two.

24
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,680
She wore a crimson brocade robe
with cloud patterns,

25
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,920
a white fox cloak,
and little white silk socks,

26
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,800
with red silk shoes with upturned toes.

27
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:06,080
She wore a gold-and-jade Longevity Lock,

28
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,840
engraved with "Long Life"

29
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:09,880
and "Endless Blessings".

30
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,000
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

31
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,560
This is the one.

32
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,800
Then who is
the Lady Wei Rao at Xianzhuang?

33
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,320
How could something
so bizarre and horrifying happen?

34
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:42,840
Who are you?
Why are you sneaking around out there?

35
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,120
Spare me, My Lord. Your Ladyship.

36
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:48,200
I thought this courtyard was abandoned,

37
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:50,160
so I came looking for valuables.

38
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,920
So you're a thief!

39
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:54,480
You recognized him as Lord Lu at once,

40
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,760
and I as Noble Lady Wu'an.

41
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,080
You're clearly no common thief.

42
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,600
Much appreciated, sir.

43
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,880
Please take him
back to the Court of Justice

44
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,280
and question him thoroughly.

45
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,840
No need to ask, Your Ladyship.

46
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,120
The Court of Justice

47
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:07,240
has plenty of ways
to deal with petty thieves.

48
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,720
Your Ladyship, forgive me! Please!

49
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,800
I lied! I'm not a thief!

50
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,640
I-I-I'm…

51
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,600
Escort the Deputy Justice out.

52
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,280
Everyone else, wait outside the courtyard.

53
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:24,840
Yes.

54
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:43,720
Your Ladyship, my name is Lv Lun.

55
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,720
I'm a steward
at the Earl of Cheng'an's estate.

56
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:49,160
My wife is surnamed Chang.
She once served Lady Guo.

57
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,520
Three days ago,
my wife fled the residence,

58
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:54,440
but someone murdered her.

59
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,720
Who killed her?

60
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:58,680
The fake Lady Wei Rao at Xianzhuang!

61
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,760
How do you know she's an impostor?

62
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:07,320
My wife discovered
the truth about her identity,

63
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,720
and was killed and silenced.

64
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:13,040
I also know
what really happened back then.

65
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,080
Rather than live in fear every night,

66
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,640
waiting to be murdered,

67
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:19,400
I chose to risk
coming to you, Your Ladyship.

68
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:21,640
I only hope this can atone for my crimes

69
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,560
and spare my life, Your Ladyship!

70
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,960
Tell me everything you know.

71
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,440
Leave nothing out.

72
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,280
If you lie about a single word,

73
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,360
I'll break every bone
in your body, one by one!

74
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:35,560
I wouldn't dare! Every word I say is true.

75
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:37,000
It was Wei Heng'e.

76
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,600
She hated Second Madam Zhou…

77
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:42,360
No. She hated Lady Li for abandoning
her daughter and remarrying.

78
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,720
She bribed the wet nurse and guards

79
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,680
to deliberately abandon Lady Wei Rao.

80
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:49,240
My wife saw it all herself.

81
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,640
Over a year later,

82
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,400
Lady Li couldn't bear losing her daughter.

83
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,920
She kept searching everywhere.

84
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,760
To keep His Majesty from blaming
the Earl of Cheng'an's family,

85
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,240
Wei Heng'e came up
with another vicious plan.

86
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,560
She found a girl
of similar age and appearance

87
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:03,040
to take Lady Wei Rao's place.

88
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,680
Your Ladyship, I can testify

89
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,480
that the Wei Rao
at Xianzhuang is an impostor.

90
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,160
You, Your Ladyship,

91
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:12,320
are the true daughter
of the Earl's family.

92
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,120
We have both witnesses and evidence.

93
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,280
What's on your mind?

94
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,600
No.

95
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,240
No, something's wrong.

96
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:32,320
There are still
too many things that don't add up.

97
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:38,080
Finding two young girls
who look nearly identical

98
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:40,200
and are about the same age is hard enough.

99
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,400
Yet all these years,

100
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:47,240
Wei Heng'e has treasured her brother's
only daughter.

101
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,600
For this fake Wei Rao,

102
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,280
she even found a substitute bride.

103
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,720
That makes no sense at all.

104
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,240
Jundai and I

105
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,600
do look very much alike.

106
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,840
Wei Heng'e and your birth father…

107
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,400
were twins.

108
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,400
- Jundai is her daughter.
- Jundai is her daughter.

109
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,240
I'm going to
the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

110
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,400
I need to see Old Madam Wei.

111
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,400
Right now.

112
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,960
<i>I know how to handle this.</i>

113
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,520
<i>You should return to camp, My Lord.</i>

114
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:28,400
<i>Don't let me delay matters of state.</i>

115
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,840
Zhao Song.

116
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:35,960
Go with her to the Wei Residence.
Take more men with you.

117
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,240
- Yes, My Lord.
- Zhao Bai.

118
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,520
Pick 200 elite soldiers from the camp.

119
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,880
- I have another use for them.
- Yes.

120
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:47,320
- My Lord, that maid Bitao…
- Tell me on the way.

121
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,120
Lady Li,

122
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,400
the men sent to fetch Madam Qiao are back.

123
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:01,560
They were ambushed on the way.

124
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:04,560
Madam Qiao and the other two are missing.

125
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,960
Who else would dare

126
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,600
abduct them in broad daylight but her?

127
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:16,560
So young, yet so brazen!

128
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:18,720
Has the Empress Dowager's procession
left the palace?

129
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:21,160
Don't worry, Lady Li. Aman went to check.

130
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:24,720
Lady Li,

131
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,680
the Empress Dowager's royal carriage
is already 20 miles outside the city.

132
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,760
The Empress
and the other consorts went with her.

133
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:30,680
Good.

134
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,400
All that patience wasn't for nothing.

135
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,039
I've finally lived to see this day.

136
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:38,760
The Empress Dowager has gone
to the hot springs for treatment.

137
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:42,280
Now I can cut out this rot
without holding back.

138
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,880
By the time she returns to the capital,

139
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,880
it'll all be over.

140
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:50,320
Prepare the carriage.
I'm leaving the palace.

141
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,120
- Yes.
- Yes, Your Ladyship.

142
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,120
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

143
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:12,160
Those two pretty girls
were just playthings to pass the time.

144
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,360
Not worth upsetting Mother this much.

145
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,360
I've already moved them
out of the residence.

146
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,040
They're fragile ladies.

147
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,080
Weak and delicate.

148
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:24,280
Losing support all at once,

149
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:26,920
they are bound to struggle to get by.

150
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,200
I understand.

151
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,120
GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

152
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,480
As for their expenses,

153
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,040
I'll find an excuse

154
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,200
to pay them from the household account.

155
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:43,600
With a wife like you,
what more could I ask for?

156
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,080
It's simply my duty.

157
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,560
Oh, right.

158
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:51,280
Lady Chun had abdominal pain
for half the night last night.

159
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:54,480
We called a physician,
but he couldn't find the cause.

160
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,120
You should go check on her.

161
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:00,320
She's always throwing tantrums.

162
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:04,720
If everyone were as sensible
and understanding as you,

163
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,600
I'd have far fewer headaches.

164
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,400
Farewell, My Lord.

165
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,800
I'll go see her.

166
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,520
My back…

167
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,640
This is really getting in the way.

168
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,160
Brother.

169
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:25,560
Can't you see
your brother can barely move?

170
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:28,560
You're a grown woman.
How can you still be so reckless and rude?

171
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:30,120
Rude.

172
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:38,880
Yufeng, save me! Yufeng, please save me!

173
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,880
Get up first. Come on.

174
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,120
You may leave.

175
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,320
Yes.

176
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:56,920
Yufeng, I just saw Noble Lady Wu'an.

177
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,560
She brought a man here under guard.

178
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,800
I sent men to find out why.

179
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,880
She actually has a witness and evidence

180
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,280
proving she's the real Wei Rao.

181
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,440
I'd had my suspicions before.

182
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,840
After all, she looks…

183
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:10,040
But strange things happen in this world.

184
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:12,120
Two people looking alike
isn't that unusual.

185
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,240
Besides, back then,

186
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:17,600
that child was clearly dead.

187
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,840
She's dead!

188
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,880
We all saw it with our own eyes.

189
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,960
Could it be

190
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,280
that the dead
really can come back to life?

191
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:32,720
Yufeng… She's really back.

192
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:35,120
She's come back! You have to help me.

193
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,560
If you refuse to save me now,

194
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:40,560
a truly catastrophic disaster awaits us!

195
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:45,560
There's always a way out. Don't panic.

196
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,160
But she…

197
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:52,240
Zhou Fu and I
were sisters-in-law for years.

198
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,080
I know her better than anyone.

199
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:56,360
She's clever.

200
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,560
Too clever for her own good.

201
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,000
People who are proud

202
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,560
and strong-willed

203
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:09,600
are often stubborn
and determined to have their own way.

204
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:12,120
All these years in the palace,

205
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:16,240
she's lived in luxury,
above everyone else.

206
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:18,600
Now she can't stand anyone defying her.

207
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,560
‪GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

208
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:24,000
Use that weakness to your advantage.

209
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,640
It's just…

210
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:30,240
Yufeng, you have another way?

211
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,880
It's a vicious plan.

212
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,680
It may bring bad karma.

213
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,600
Forget it. Pretend I said nothing.

214
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:37,520
Hey…

215
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:40,440
Yufeng, I'll do whatever you say.

216
00:12:40,520 --> 00:12:42,560
As long as you can save me,

217
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,000
I'll give you anything you want.

218
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:47,560
- Yufeng…
- No. We really can't.

219
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:49,720
Yufeng, we're out of time!

220
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:52,160
Just tell me what to do.

221
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:54,560
Works or not,
I'll take full responsibility.

222
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,680
I won't drag you into this.

223
00:12:56,760 --> 00:12:59,080
And for the rest of my life,

224
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:01,560
I'll never forget what you've done for me.

225
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:07,040
Since it's come to this,

226
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,440
we might as well try.

227
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,720
Whether it works is up to fate.

228
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,400
Who's there?

229
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,160
It's me, Grandmother.

230
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,040
You're sick too.

231
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:07,320
Didn't the physician tell you
to get plenty of rest?

232
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:10,440
I don't need you tending to me.

233
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:12,240
Go back and rest.

234
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:14,040
I've been confined
to the Wei family since childhood,

235
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,840
so I never had the chance
to be close to you.

236
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:17,440
Now that I finally have this chance,

237
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:20,120
I only wish to stay
by your side every day.

238
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:22,920
How could caring for you ever be a burden?

239
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,400
Grandmother, you don't look well.

240
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:33,160
At my age…

241
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:36,080
A few aches and fevers are inevitable.

242
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:40,200
But today, for some reason,
I feel especially drowsy.

243
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,000
I have no strength at all.

244
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:50,080
Perhaps you've caught a chill.
We shouldn't take it lightly.

245
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:53,280
Lie down and rest, Grandmother.
I'll fetch the physician.

246
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,840
All right.

247
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,760
Take good care of her.

248
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,360
- Yes.
- Yes.

249
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,720
Go tell Grandmother I'm here.

250
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:22,800
I have matters to discuss.

251
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,800
Young Master, Old Madam has taken a chill.

252
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:26,480
She suffers from headache and fever,
and has remained in a deep sleep.

253
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,360
I didn't dare disturb her.

254
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,600
That's strange.

255
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,840
She's always been in excellent health.

256
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:34,720
She climbed the whole mountain
at Double Ninth without stopping.

257
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,440
How did she suddenly fall ill?

258
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:38,760
Has a physician seen her?

259
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,600
The physician took her pulse.

260
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:43,080
He said a chill
had weakened her vital energy.

261
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,000
He prescribed Cinnamon Twig Decoction
to dispel the chill.

262
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:47,760
Then I'll come back later.

263
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:53,000
Has Wei Rao been here?

264
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,600
Yes, Young Master.

265
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:56,920
Physician Wang first wanted
to prescribe Ephedra Decoction.

266
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,480
Young Lady called him
an incompetent old fool.

267
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:00,440
She said sweating
is in need of Cinnamon Twig Decoction.

268
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,920
Then Physicians Li and Zhang
confirmed the diagnosis

269
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,640
before Old Madam took the medicine.

270
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:07,560
Young Lady stayed with Old Madam
until she'd taken her medicine.

271
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,560
She's certainly attentive.

272
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:13,000
- Tell me as soon as Grandmother wakes.
- Yes.

273
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:17,320
HERON LODGE

274
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:21,760
<i>Aunt Heng'e, I've cleared</i>
<i>every obstacle from your path.</i>

275
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:24,000
<i>Don't disappoint me.</i>

276
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:35,040
<i>Lu Zhuo. I won't let you</i>
<i>ruin my plans again today.</i>

277
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:38,800
<i>It's time to end this once and for all.</i>

278
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:41,440
Wait!

279
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:44,440
Lady Li!

280
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:47,040
Make way for Lady Li! Anyone blocking
her procession gets 100 lashes!

281
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,240
Lower your head!

282
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,400
Lady Li.

283
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:51,880
Someone from the Earl of Cheng'an's family
seeks an audience.

284
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:54,840
Lady Li!
I have something urgent to report.

285
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:57,560
I'm from the Wei family. I'm Wei Heng'e!

286
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,080
So it really is an old acquaintance.

287
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,320
It's been 16 years.

288
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,800
It truly has been a long time.

289
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:06,440
Let her through.

290
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:14,720
Wei Heng'e greets Lady Li.

291
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:15,960
Wei Heng'e.

292
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:20,079
I remember how
you always had a rule for everything.

293
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:23,200
If a widowed sister-in-law
grieved too deeply,

294
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:26,480
she was inconsiderate
to her elders and called unfilial.

295
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:30,920
If she'd cried herself dry
and had no tears left,

296
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,680
she was called heartless.

297
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:35,040
If she consulted a male physician,

298
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:38,480
you'd gossip behind her back

299
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:40,800
and call her shameless.

300
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,720
Clearly, you hold
proper conduct above all else.

301
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:46,080
Then you should know

302
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,520
the Imperial Family has its dignity.

303
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,840
Anyone who disrupts a royal procession

304
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:53,480
cannot be easily pardoned.

305
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:58,160
Now I'd like to know

306
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,680
what could be so important

307
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,840
that you had to barge into my procession.

308
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:07,880
If your reason isn't good enough,
you'll get 100 lashes.

309
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,960
There's no getting out of that.

310
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,200
Everything I did before

311
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,600
was because I was blind and foolish.

312
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:16,440
I offended you, Lady Li.

313
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,960
I'll gladly take the lashes.

314
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,760
I only ask for your mercy.

315
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:24,720
But this concerns Noble Lady Wu'an.

316
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:27,440
It concerns your own daughter.

317
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:28,800
Please hear me out.

318
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:32,520
For my late brother's sake,

319
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:34,240
please grant me this favor.

320
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,480
Let the Wei family come along.

321
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:51,160
South Mountain isn't far from the capital.

322
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:54,600
This close to the Emperor,
it should be peaceful.

323
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:58,480
So why can't
these few bandits be wiped out?

324
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:03,160
The bandits of South Mountain
have long plagued the court.

325
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:05,040
His Majesty
has sent troops there many times,

326
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,840
but the more we kill, the more appear.

327
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:09,040
Traveling merchants are terrified of them.

328
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:10,680
Here.

329
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:12,000
The terrain there is treacherous.

330
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,800
Easy to defend, hard to attack.

331
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,320
The bandits are scattered
across the peaks.

332
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:17,320
They hide by day and strike at night.

333
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,800
When troops climb the mountain, they flee.

334
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,800
We can barely find them,
much less wipe them out.

335
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:23,680
But that's the Northern Army's problem.

336
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:25,600
What does it have to do with you, Lord Lu?

337
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:27,240
Why the sudden interest?

338
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,760
My Lord, the troops are assembled.

339
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,000
We're ready to set out.

340
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:34,800
My Lord.

341
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,120
My Lord, word just came from the palace.

342
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:39,800
His Majesty is coming
to inspect the troops today.

343
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:42,040
The Imperial procession
has already left Sima Gate.

344
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:45,920
Put the entire army on high alert!

345
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,440
Assemble all the generals.

346
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:49,200
Come with me to prepare
the drill grounds at once!

347
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:54,240
- No. Something's wrong.
- What is it?

348
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,560
The grand review isn't due yet.

349
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,920
the troops are caught unprepared.

350
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:00,640
Inspecting troops
in peacetime breaks protocol.

351
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,000
Why did His Majesty
suddenly change his mind?

352
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:06,080
Something about this doesn't feel right.

353
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:08,320
It is strange.

354
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:10,360
But if His Majesty just got a whim,

355
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,640
we just receive him.

356
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,040
Don't overthink it.

357
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:15,480
His Majesty moved the inspection up.

358
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:17,320
Someone may have put him up to it.

359
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:20,240
I have something urgent to handle.

360
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:23,440
Shunqin. I'm leaving the camp to you.

361
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:26,280
Find a way to stall the Imperial carriage.

362
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:30,320
Hey you…

363
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,320
Where are you going at a time like this?

364
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:37,920
What am I supposed to tell His Majesty?

365
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,680
Even His Majesty can't break protocol.

366
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:42,840
Just say the camp's defenses aren't ready

367
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:43,760
and His Majesty's safety could be at risk.

368
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:46,720
Remember, get several censors to join you

369
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:47,640
and do everything you can to stop him.

370
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:49,160
Are you out of your mind?

371
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,360
What could matter more than your life?

372
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:53,920
You can't just halt
His Majesty's procession.

373
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,280
No. You're not going anywhere.

374
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:57,640
Whatever it is, it can wait.

375
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:00,320
You're coming with me
to receive His Majesty!

376
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:03,040
General Qi is right.
Please think this through, My Lord.

377
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:06,680
I'm counting on you. Move out!

378
00:21:12,600 --> 00:21:14,840
ZHAO

379
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,960
That fool. That absolute fool!

380
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,400
I haven't even told him about Bitao yet.

381
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,960
What happened to Bitao?

382
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:24,320
N-Nothing.

383
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:25,640
Maybe I'm just overthinking it.

384
00:21:26,520 --> 00:21:28,520
Who knows when His Lordship will be back?

385
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,320
SOUTH MOUNTAIN BANDIT STRONGHOLD

386
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:34,760
Top it up.

387
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:36,680
Drink up.

388
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:40,320
The soldiers are coming! The soldiers!

389
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,880
Soldiers!

390
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:43,640
The soldiers are coming!

391
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:45,280
The soldiers are coming!

392
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:57,680
Move!

393
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,360
- Move!
- Hurry!

394
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:05,680
Look closely.

395
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:08,240
Do you recognize these two?

396
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:12,400
No. No… I don't know them…

397
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,320
Kill him.

398
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:16,800
No! Wait! Wait! Spare me, General!

399
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:18,680
I've truly never seen them!

400
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:21,880
On South Mountain alone,
there are thirteen major strongholds.

401
00:22:21,960 --> 00:22:24,520
Their leaders are all ruthless killers.

402
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:26,520
General, perhaps
you've got the wrong place.

403
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,320
Thirteen?

404
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,680
That's no problem.

405
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,760
We'll wipe them out one by one.

406
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:36,520
We'll leave heads rolling
and the mountains red with blood.

407
00:22:36,600 --> 00:22:39,200
Before dawn tomorrow, we'll find them.

408
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:41,320
No, no, wait!

409
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:44,160
I'll do whatever you ask, General!

410
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:46,200
My patience is running thin.

411
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:48,800
You'll lead the way
and get us through their gates.

412
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,520
Before sunset,

413
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:54,520
I want all thirteen heads.
Lined up neatly! Not one missing.

414
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:56,160
At your command, General.

415
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:00,760
XIANZHUANG

416
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:02,520
Everything you just said

417
00:23:02,600 --> 00:23:04,200
is true?

418
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:05,880
She harbored a runaway servant
from the Wei family

419
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:08,360
and dug into Rao's disappearance
from years ago.

420
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:10,240
Who knows what she's really plotting?

421
00:23:11,040 --> 00:23:13,320
Heaven and earth are my witnesses.

422
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:15,760
I swear on my late brother.

423
00:23:15,840 --> 00:23:17,000
If a single word is false,

424
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:20,200
may I meet a terrible end.

425
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:24,240
This concerns Lady Li's beloved daughter.

426
00:23:24,320 --> 00:23:25,640
I dared not hide it from you.

427
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:28,760
For the sake of your own flesh and blood,

428
00:23:29,440 --> 00:23:32,400
please judge this fairly
and give Rao justice.

429
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:35,880
Lady Li.

430
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:38,280
Old Madam Wei, Lady Guo,

431
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:39,880
and Noble Lady Wu'an request an audience.

432
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:42,600
Very well.

433
00:23:43,320 --> 00:23:44,920
Everyone who should be here is here.

434
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:46,600
Let them in.

435
00:23:47,320 --> 00:23:48,240
Yes.

436
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:06,560
Lady Li summons Old Madam Wei
and Noble Lady Wu'an.

437
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:16,800
Rao, come inside with me.

438
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:54,440
DWELLING IN TRUTH, DEEP IN THE WOODS

439
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:57,720
No need for formalities.

440
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:01,240
Old Madam Wei, have a seat.

441
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:11,080
Your timing is perfect, Noble Lady Wu'an.

442
00:25:11,800 --> 00:25:13,280
Even if you hadn't come today,

443
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:15,600
I would've sent for you.

444
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:20,520
I trust you haven't forgotten my warning.

445
00:25:20,600 --> 00:25:24,080
- Lady Li…
- Whatever you wish to reprimand her for,

446
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:28,600
wait until you've seen
the evidence she brought.

447
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:31,160
Tell Lady Li

448
00:25:31,240 --> 00:25:34,440
exactly what you told me.

449
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:40,960
Lady Li, A-Chou…

450
00:25:41,040 --> 00:25:43,120
No, Noble Lady Wu'an

451
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:44,880
is not my biological daughter.

452
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:47,040
Sixteen years ago,

453
00:25:47,120 --> 00:25:49,920
I found her under
an old cypress tree on the rear hill.

454
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:51,480
My eldest daughter died young,

455
00:25:51,560 --> 00:25:53,200
so I took the risk

456
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:55,160
of giving this child A-Chou's identity

457
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:57,200
and raised her as my own poor daughter.

458
00:25:57,840 --> 00:26:00,040
I selfishly hid the truth from her.

459
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:01,920
I deserve death for my crime.

460
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:03,920
Please have mercy, Lady Li.

461
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:12,000
You found her on the mountain?

462
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:15,360
Yes. I found her there.

463
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,240
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

464
00:26:17,320 --> 00:26:20,200
Wei Rao was abducted
and vanished without a trace.

465
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:22,840
Someone clearly plotted to harm her

466
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:25,720
and wanted her dead. Lv Lun.

467
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:30,600
Lady Li, my wife, Madam Chang,

468
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:32,440
served at the Wei Residence for years.

469
00:26:32,520 --> 00:26:35,280
She knew everything that happened there.

470
00:26:35,360 --> 00:26:38,320
One day, she happened to see her.
It was her!

471
00:26:39,080 --> 00:26:40,600
She bribed the wet nurse and guards

472
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:43,200
and conspired with criminals
to kidnap and sell the young lady.

473
00:26:43,280 --> 00:26:45,840
Afterward, fearing she'd be executed,

474
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:48,560
she cruelly abandoned
the young lady in the wilderness

475
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:50,760
and left her to die!

476
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:52,840
The night the young lady disappeared,

477
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:55,240
- she was wearing crimson…
- You don't need to tell me that.

478
00:26:55,320 --> 00:26:58,400
The night Wei Rao disappeared,
the court posted notices everywhere.

479
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:00,160
Everyone knew what she was wearing.

480
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:02,720
A crimson brocade robe with cloud patterns

481
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:05,120
under a white fox cloak.

482
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,920
What? Did you find them?

483
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:08,400
Of course.

484
00:27:09,640 --> 00:27:11,960
My adoptive mother hid them
under the stove for years.

485
00:27:12,040 --> 00:27:13,680
We only just found them.

486
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:15,920
Bitao.

487
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:23,120
Here's the evidence.

488
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:24,360
One look and you'll know, Lady Li.

489
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,440
Yinggu.

490
00:28:42,040 --> 00:28:43,720
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

491
00:29:04,360 --> 00:29:06,160
- This one's pretty.
- Pretty, isn't it?

492
00:29:06,240 --> 00:29:08,600
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

493
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,680
All you know
is the gift for your daughter.

494
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:16,920
Here.

495
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:22,800
Here. I'll put it on you.

496
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:47,000
Mother… I…

497
00:30:11,280 --> 00:30:13,760
That's right. Back then, Wei Jin

498
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:17,160
personally engraved the Longevity Lock

499
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:21,200
with "Long Life" and "Endless Blessings."

500
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,840
But when Rao was born,

501
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:27,600
I named her Mingzhu.

502
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:30,440
My precious girl,

503
00:30:30,520 --> 00:30:32,400
cherished like a pearl in my palm.

504
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:35,560
But fearing it would
diminish her blessings,

505
00:30:36,080 --> 00:30:37,400
I only dared to engrave tiny words

506
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:39,920
on the back of the Longevity Lock…

507
00:30:40,720 --> 00:30:43,640
"To my beloved daughter, Mingzhu."

508
00:30:44,320 --> 00:30:48,040
Those tiny words
were never recorded in the case files,

509
00:30:48,120 --> 00:30:50,040
and very few people knew about them.

510
00:30:52,360 --> 00:30:54,480
But on the back of this Longevity Lock,

511
00:30:55,520 --> 00:30:57,000
there's nothing at all.

512
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:14,440
How…

513
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:16,520
How can that be?

514
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:23,520
When I found Noble Lady Wu'an,

515
00:31:23,600 --> 00:31:25,480
she was wearing this very Longevity Lock.

516
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:27,840
I knew it was tied to her true identity.

517
00:31:28,520 --> 00:31:30,680
I feared someone would discover it
and take my child away.

518
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:33,840
We were poor, but I never dared sell it.

519
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:35,680
This is the one.

520
00:31:38,040 --> 00:31:42,440
Lady Li, could there be some mistake?

521
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:44,040
Mother,

522
00:31:44,120 --> 00:31:47,960
you raised Rao yourself
from the time she was little.

523
00:31:48,040 --> 00:31:50,240
There was never any doubt
about who she was.

524
00:31:50,840 --> 00:31:53,400
Now someone else has come to claim her,

525
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:56,640
so the keepsake must match perfectly

526
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:58,480
before anyone can believe it.

527
00:31:58,560 --> 00:32:01,400
Please stay calm.

528
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,520
Let Lady Li

529
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:06,080
question them carefully.

530
00:32:07,280 --> 00:32:08,240
Lv Lun.

531
00:32:09,360 --> 00:32:11,480
Where is your wife, Madam Chang?

532
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:12,480
She's dead.

533
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:14,800
She was murdered!

534
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:16,400
Wei Heng'e.

535
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:18,960
Did you murder Madam Chang?

536
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,640
I've been framed, Lady Li!

537
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:25,720
That woman stole valuables
and fled the residence.

538
00:32:25,800 --> 00:32:28,320
She fell off a cliff.
She got what she deserved.

539
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:31,080
Rao is my own niece.

540
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:33,760
I'm married, and I can't inherit
my brother's family's wealth anyway.

541
00:32:33,840 --> 00:32:36,840
The claim that I'd harm Wei Rao
makes no sense at all.

542
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,960
This man is treacherous and greedy.

543
00:32:40,040 --> 00:32:42,640
He and his wife were partners in crime.

544
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:45,560
Now he's helping outsiders
falsely accuse his own masters!

545
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:47,560
What could he possibly be after?

546
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:51,200
Lady Li, please see the truth!

547
00:32:51,800 --> 00:32:54,280
Give him 40 lashes,
then question him again!

548
00:32:54,920 --> 00:32:57,000
- Guards!
- Mercy, Lady Li! Please!

549
00:32:57,080 --> 00:32:58,920
Everything I said is true!

550
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:02,120
I-I wouldn't dare lie!
Mercy, Lady Li! Mercy!

551
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,520
- You can't beat a confession out of him!
- Mercy please!

552
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:05,120
You don't get to speak.

553
00:33:14,280 --> 00:33:16,920
I'll confess!

554
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:18,680
I'll tell you everything!

555
00:33:22,360 --> 00:33:23,640
Lady Li,

556
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,840
I lied.

557
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:27,360
The truth is,

558
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:30,080
I was acting on Noble Lady Wu'an's orders!

559
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:48,040
Hurry! Faster!

560
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,800
Mother, what message did His Lordship send

561
00:33:50,880 --> 00:33:52,960
that has you rushing
to Xianzhuang like this?

562
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:55,800
Why not bring Sister with us?

563
00:33:56,520 --> 00:33:58,320
Does this concern Noble Lady Wu'an?

564
00:33:58,400 --> 00:34:01,400
She can't handle serious matters.
She'd only make things worse.

565
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:03,080
You're levelheaded.

566
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:06,400
Don't ask questions now.
You'll know when we get there.

567
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:09,880
You there!

568
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,040
What's going on?

569
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:15,560
Madam, two carriages
collided at the city gate.

570
00:34:15,639 --> 00:34:17,040
Neither side will back down,

571
00:34:17,120 --> 00:34:18,159
so they've blocked the gate.

572
00:34:18,239 --> 00:34:19,520
Take another route. Now!

573
00:34:19,600 --> 00:34:21,960
Going around the west side
will be a long detour.

574
00:34:22,040 --> 00:34:24,080
We may not reach
the estate until the Xu hour.

575
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:27,400
This is bad. Very bad.

576
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:30,120
Make way for the Duke's carriage!

577
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,760
Take the detour! Hurry!

578
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:38,840
She…

579
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:40,639
She gave me 200 coins

580
00:34:40,719 --> 00:34:43,880
and told me to make up lies
to frame Lady Heng'e!

581
00:34:43,960 --> 00:34:46,440
That story about bribing
the wet nurse and swapping the girl

582
00:34:46,520 --> 00:34:48,000
was all made up by this fraud.

583
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:50,159
She even fabricated evidence
to deceive everyone!

584
00:34:50,239 --> 00:34:53,719
See? She even found
an identical Longevity Lock.

585
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:55,520
I didn't dare do it at first.

586
00:34:55,600 --> 00:34:57,920
But she kept tempting me.

587
00:34:58,880 --> 00:35:01,760
She knew she looked
just like Lady Wei Rao,

588
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:04,160
so she boldly hatched this scheme
to turn you against each other!

589
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:08,240
After all, my wife is already dead,

590
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:10,840
and the wet nurse and guards are dead,
leaving no witnesses.

591
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:12,920
With truth and lies all mixed up,
she could easily manipulate things.

592
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:15,400
If you believed even part of her story,

593
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:17,160
she could make the rest look true

594
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:19,160
and claim the title of Noble Lady,

595
00:35:19,240 --> 00:35:21,800
living in wealth and luxury forever!

596
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:23,800
She even promised me
a mansion and fertile land,

597
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,600
plus a beautiful new wife.

598
00:35:25,680 --> 00:35:28,600
I lost my head for a moment.
Greed blinded me.

599
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:31,040
I deserve death!

600
00:35:31,120 --> 00:35:33,200
- You lying snake!
- I deserve death!

601
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:35,840
You claimed to be
a Wei servant seeking my protection,

602
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:37,560
but someone had already bought you off!

603
00:35:37,640 --> 00:35:38,920
You set this trap to frame me!

604
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:40,560
If this Longevity Lock is fake,

605
00:35:40,640 --> 00:35:42,880
then the clothes, shoes,
and socks must be fake too?

606
00:35:42,960 --> 00:35:45,440
I was only a child.
What could I possibly have known

607
00:35:45,520 --> 00:35:46,880
about the personal belongings

608
00:35:46,960 --> 00:35:49,120
of a noble girl
from the Earl's household years ago?

609
00:35:49,200 --> 00:35:50,640
Even if they're all fake,

610
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:53,200
why were the fleeing wet nurse and guards

611
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:54,720
killed at South Mountain of all places?

612
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:57,720
If that wasn't silencing witnesses,
what was it?

613
00:35:57,800 --> 00:36:00,080
How dare you tell such a shameless lie?

614
00:36:00,160 --> 00:36:02,120
Aren't you afraid of divine punishment?

615
00:36:02,200 --> 00:36:05,480
Lady Li, I have proof of what I said.

616
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:09,240
I didn't spend a single coin
of the bribe she gave me.

617
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:12,760
I buried it all outside the city,
under the old elm tree on Jiwei Slope.

618
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:15,280
If you don't believe me,
send someone to dig it up.

619
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:21,800
Guards.

620
00:36:22,840 --> 00:36:24,000
Take him to retrieve the evidence.

621
00:36:27,360 --> 00:36:28,320
Move!

622
00:36:29,520 --> 00:36:31,440
Lady Li, when the evidence was found,

623
00:36:32,040 --> 00:36:33,360
Lord Lu saw it himself.

624
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:36,040
- He can testify for me.
- Lord Lu?

625
00:36:37,280 --> 00:36:40,120
You've bewitched Lord Lu so completely
he can't tell right from wrong.

626
00:36:40,200 --> 00:36:41,800
And you expect him to judge the truth?

627
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:45,960
Child traffickers would never
leave evidence behind.

628
00:36:46,040 --> 00:36:48,440
They'd have burned or buried it long ago.

629
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:53,560
These are all fake!

630
00:36:54,160 --> 00:36:56,560
Fake! Every last one is fake!

631
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:07,000
The substitute bride I found back then

632
00:37:07,640 --> 00:37:10,280
was so greedy

633
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:14,320
she spun an outrageous lie
to take Rao's place!

634
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:18,280
It's my fault. As her aunt,

635
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:21,880
I let a wolf into our home and harmed Rao!

636
00:37:22,440 --> 00:37:23,280
Lady Li,

637
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:25,080
this mother and daughter

638
00:37:25,160 --> 00:37:28,280
conspired in secret
to impersonate a noblewoman.

639
00:37:29,200 --> 00:37:31,320
They must not be spared!

640
00:37:31,400 --> 00:37:33,600
No! I swear we didn't!

641
00:37:33,680 --> 00:37:35,800
I truly picked up Noble Lady Wu'an.

642
00:37:35,880 --> 00:37:37,080
I wouldn't dare lie.

643
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:41,360
Rao isn't your biological daughter.

644
00:37:42,720 --> 00:37:45,640
Yet you're so eager to condemn me.

645
00:37:46,640 --> 00:37:48,000
What are you really after?

646
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:50,480
What am I after?

647
00:37:50,560 --> 00:37:52,360
What could I possibly want?

648
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:54,440
I only feel sorry for the poor child

649
00:37:54,520 --> 00:37:56,320
that my late brother left behind.

650
00:37:58,120 --> 00:37:59,560
Yes, pitiful indeed.

651
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:04,040
My birth father died in battle

652
00:38:04,120 --> 00:38:06,960
and entrusted his young daughter
to his own family,

653
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:09,920
hoping you

654
00:38:10,520 --> 00:38:12,800
would raise and cherish his precious girl.

655
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:15,400
How could he know his own sister

656
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:18,240
would swap two girls
for her own selfish gain?

657
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:22,200
One grew up pampered in luxury,

658
00:38:22,720 --> 00:38:25,160
while the other lived in poverty,
driven to the brink!

659
00:38:27,040 --> 00:38:30,120
Wei Heng'e, ask yourself.

660
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:31,720
After everything you've done,

661
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:34,040
can you face
the brother who died in battle?

662
00:38:34,120 --> 00:38:36,640
- Can you face your own conscience?
- Shut your mouth!

663
00:38:37,240 --> 00:38:38,520
My conscience is clear!

664
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:42,080
I did nothing! I can swear to Heaven!

665
00:38:42,160 --> 00:38:43,280
What would I have to fear?

666
00:38:53,080 --> 00:38:53,920
Bitao.

667
00:38:55,520 --> 00:38:58,120
You grew up in our Wei family.

668
00:38:58,200 --> 00:39:00,760
You were always by Lady Wei Rao's side.

669
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:02,800
She cared for you more than anyone.

670
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:07,240
How could you forget
all the Wei family did for you

671
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,760
and help someone commit such evil?

672
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:10,640
How could you serve an impostor?

673
00:39:11,560 --> 00:39:12,520
Bitao.

674
00:39:12,600 --> 00:39:15,920
Tell us. What do you know?

675
00:39:41,600 --> 00:39:42,920
It was you.

676
00:39:46,720 --> 00:39:48,960
You switched the Longevity Lock.

677
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:51,960
Your Ladyship…

678
00:39:52,720 --> 00:39:53,800
I…

679
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:55,680
I…

680
00:39:58,040 --> 00:40:00,760
Keep stalling, and you'll anger Lady Li.

681
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:02,880
Then you'll be dragged out
and beaten to death!

682
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:05,440
Your parents and brothers
will be punished too!

683
00:40:08,040 --> 00:40:09,680
You'd better tell the truth.

684
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:13,120
Don't be afraid.
As long as you tell the truth,

685
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:17,520
Lady Li will see that justice is done.

686
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:19,680
Speak! Have you lost your voice?

687
00:40:20,200 --> 00:40:21,160
I said, speak!

688
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,880
So that's how it is.

689
00:40:49,720 --> 00:40:52,360
From the very first day
I entered the Wei Residence,

690
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:56,560
someone had already planted
a pawn by my side,

691
00:40:58,120 --> 00:41:00,160
waiting for this very day.

692
00:41:02,520 --> 00:41:05,800
I was too foolish, too naive,

693
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:09,640
too desperate to find my birth mother

694
00:41:11,600 --> 00:41:13,840
to see the trap right in front of me.

695
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:23,080
Wei Heng'e.

696
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:29,040
When I disappeared back then,

697
00:41:29,600 --> 00:41:32,480
you must have had help
inside the residence to switch us!

698
00:41:34,720 --> 00:41:37,240
- Who could that have been?
- You…

699
00:41:40,280 --> 00:41:42,880
You certainly have a sharp tongue.

700
00:41:43,680 --> 00:41:44,920
You turn defense into attack

701
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:47,720
and keep pressing your accusations.

702
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:49,440
You have no proof,

703
00:41:49,520 --> 00:41:53,280
yet you twist the truth
and falsely accuse others.

704
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:58,160
You're still young.
Stay on the right path.

705
00:41:58,680 --> 00:42:02,560
Don't make a foolish choice you'll regret.

706
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:05,640
A Longevity Lock can be forged.

707
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:07,760
Witnesses can be bought.

708
00:42:11,280 --> 00:42:12,720
It's been 16 years.

709
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:15,800
Someone has deliberately interfered,

710
00:42:15,880 --> 00:42:17,720
trying to turn truth into lies

711
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:19,680
and keep a mother and daughter apart.

712
00:42:20,240 --> 00:42:21,640
But I want to ask you,

713
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:24,680
Lady Li.

714
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:29,800
Why did you lose your own daughter?

715
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:31,920
And why,

716
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:35,120
when she's standing right in front of you,
do you refuse to see the truth

717
00:42:35,200 --> 00:42:37,920
and let them make up lies to slander her?

718
00:42:45,200 --> 00:42:46,280
Why?

719
00:42:56,640 --> 00:42:57,800
Mother!

720
00:43:14,600 --> 00:43:17,600
Mother, you're confused.
How can you believe a fraud?

721
00:43:17,680 --> 00:43:21,360
She uses sweet words
to twist right and wrong.

722
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:25,080
You'll believe her,
but not your own daughter?

723
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:28,320
Mother, look at me.

724
00:43:29,960 --> 00:43:31,320
Feel this.

725
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:35,320
When you left the Wei family back then,

726
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:38,000
Grandmother was grieving
Father's early death.

727
00:43:38,080 --> 00:43:39,560
No one in the family had time for me.

728
00:43:40,160 --> 00:43:43,120
I secretly slipped out,
hoping to find you at the palace.

729
00:43:43,720 --> 00:43:45,560
But the steps were too high.

730
00:43:45,640 --> 00:43:47,960
I slipped and fell.
That's how I got this scar.

731
00:43:49,560 --> 00:43:52,240
This scar proves
how much I missed you, Mother.

732
00:43:55,160 --> 00:43:56,200
Mother.

733
00:43:57,880 --> 00:43:59,800
Mother, are you really
going to believe her

734
00:43:59,880 --> 00:44:01,480
and abandon your own daughter?

735
00:44:03,120 --> 00:44:04,480
Does it still hurt?

736
00:44:42,120 --> 00:44:45,680
How did the world come to this?

737
00:44:46,440 --> 00:44:49,480
What is real anymore? What is false?

738
00:44:49,560 --> 00:44:50,560
I…

739
00:44:52,160 --> 00:44:53,240
Mother.

740
00:44:53,880 --> 00:44:57,840
We should leave this matter to Lady Li.

741
00:44:57,920 --> 00:45:00,360
As long as Lady Li acts decisively

742
00:45:00,440 --> 00:45:01,680
and puts an end to this,

743
00:45:01,760 --> 00:45:04,760
the Lu family will know it's settled

744
00:45:04,840 --> 00:45:06,520
and won't dare object.

745
00:45:06,600 --> 00:45:09,120
No matter how bold Lu Zhuo is,

746
00:45:09,200 --> 00:45:13,040
the family is still ruled
by the upright old Duke.

747
00:45:13,640 --> 00:45:15,200
Once it's done,

748
00:45:15,280 --> 00:45:17,400
the two families can settle the rest.

749
00:45:18,000 --> 00:45:19,720
Then everything can be covered up,

750
00:45:20,320 --> 00:45:22,600
without involving the Wei family.

751
00:45:23,440 --> 00:45:25,120
You can finally rest easy.

752
00:45:25,200 --> 00:45:26,600
And we can

753
00:45:27,760 --> 00:45:32,480
give Lady Rao's late father an answer.

754
00:45:32,560 --> 00:45:36,520
My only fear is that Lady Li will hesitate

755
00:45:36,600 --> 00:45:39,320
and go soft.

756
00:45:45,600 --> 00:45:46,680
Mother.

757
00:45:47,280 --> 00:45:49,840
The evidence is conclusive now.
She has no defense left!

758
00:45:50,600 --> 00:45:52,200
Will you still indulge this liar

759
00:45:52,280 --> 00:45:55,400
and let her humiliate me in public
and disgrace Father's name?

760
00:45:56,000 --> 00:45:57,840
Mother, make your decision!

761
00:46:04,960 --> 00:46:05,920
A-Chou.

762
00:46:07,360 --> 00:46:08,720
What else do you have to say?

763
00:46:09,880 --> 00:46:11,200
I have nothing to say.

764
00:46:14,120 --> 00:46:16,480
Guards! Take her…

765
00:46:20,280 --> 00:46:21,240
Stop!

766
00:48:32,240 --> 00:48:34,480
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
